
# Aspect ratio — headless, ported from shadcn (aspect-ratio.tsx). A box that holds a fixed width/height ratio. The
# ratio is applied via CSS (theme sets aspect-ratio from a style/class); this provides the slot + styling hook.

load @cluesurf/site/code/zone/render
  find element
load @cluesurf/site/code/dom/dom
  find view
  find append

zone aspect-ratio
  take host, like view
  take class
  zone div
    bind data-slot, text <aspect-ratio>
    bind class, read class
    slot
